  "newFunctionCount": 20,
  "newFunctions": [
    "retention processor is disabled by default and malformed internal options cause no provider calls",
    "exact expired messages lose all content while persistent profiles remain unchanged",
    "a missing reserved CREATE receives a durable fence so the original request cannot resurrect content",
    "a lost modify response stays pending and a later exact inspection confirms the same content-free fence",
    "presence needs a confirmed exact fence and fresh intent before it can publish again",
    "an unconfirmed or modified presence fence never permits fresh publication",
    "account erasure accepts its own exact retention fence and removes pending local expiry work",
    "account deletion during metadata or mutation IO prevents a false expiry receipt",
    "foreign owner/type, extra metadata and mismatched fences stop before modifying CloudKit",
    "malformed full modification replies cannot prove erasure even if the provider committed a fence",
    "one conflict is not blindly retried while other verified records can finish",
    "disabling or rolling back time during checkpoint validation prevents every subsequent provider operation",
    "checkpoint rollback refuses retention before claiming or changing user records",
    "timeout retains one slot until the actual ignored provider fetch and body work finishes",
    "an aborted checkpoint fetch keeps the retention slot until its real underlying operation settles",
    "private report reason expires after thirty days without a live user session",
    "aborted body cancellation retains the slot until the original cancel promise actually settles",
    "null removed fields in a CloudKit replace response are accepted but contain no retained value",
    "public JSON transport bounds pathological fragment counts and rejects non-byte chunks",
    "real local workerd SQL and signed provider model erase expired content and restore only fresh presence"
  ],
